{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n馬來西亞藝人林明禎今日（10月23日）於加拿大出席電影節後趁機留在當地遊玩，並在社交平台分享多張性感跌膊相片及旅遊片段。她不但被大自然奇觀震撼至崩潰痛哭長達30分鐘，更在野外做出令人意想不到的破格舉動。這位女神在鏡頭前放下偶像包袱的真實反應瞬間引爆網絡熱議。\n</p>\n<h2>林明禎尼亞加拉大瀑布前激動爆喊</h2>\n<p>林明禎早前遠赴加拿大參與多倫多中華電影節，完成工作後隨即展開一場「禎華遊」，連日來不斷在網上大派福利。從她上載影片及相片可見，她身穿厚重外套配搭頸巾，下半身卻極致誘惑地穿上黑絲襪大騷美腿，期間更不經意露出香肩，惹火打扮極度吸睛。當她親身抵達世界著名的尼亞加拉大瀑布時，竟然難掩激動情緒，當場淚流滿面長達30分鐘。</p>\n<h2>林明禎親自解開痛哭流涕背後真相</h2>\n<p>面對大自然鬼斧神工，林明禎親自透過社交平台發文解釋落淚原因，直言這絕對是她人生中10大震撼景觀之一，並強烈建議大眾有機會一定要親臨現場感受那份震懾力。除了被美景感動，她隨後花了1個半小時前往當地酒莊品嚐美酒與薄餅，期間聽聞當地溪水極度純淨，竟然放下女神形象直接蹲在小溪邊試飲生水，她更發文自嘲：「每天做這些白癡事，妳媽媽知道嗎」</p>\n<h2>飛越半個地球瘋狂掃貨與吃喝玩樂</h2>\n<p>這次旅程源於多倫多中華電影節邀請，難得飛越半個地球來到北美洲，她自然不會放過任何享受人生的機會。這趟被她命名為「禎華遊」的加拿大之旅中，她毫不吝嗇地紀錄了大量吃喝與瘋狂購物的奢華日常。她穿著跌膊衛衣在街頭漫步，並將在大自然中遊玩的真實模樣一一拍下。</p>\n<h2>網民湧入留言區激讚女神可愛幽默</h2>\n<p>大批網民看完她分享的加拿大旅遊點滴後，紛紛湧入其社交平台留言洗版。不少粉絲被她直接飲用溪水的舉動逗樂，大讚她「又靚又可愛」，完全沒有高高在上的明星架子。更有網民發揮幽默本色，針對她早前在瀑布前落淚的經歷，留言笑問「有沒有試飲瀑布水」，網絡上充斥著關於她這趟異國之旅各項細節討論。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927498614791310_8870226886adb31282e7ad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"minchen333_1792653950_4013378073910337071_202698442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927498614791310_8870226886adb31282e7ad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274986904613977_1505402976adb312eb37f1.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-23 下午5.47.33.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274986904613977_1505402976adb312eb37f1.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274987887987788_20582955616adb3137b3e51.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261023100146166-1023_00862_001_07p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274987887987788_20582955616adb3137b3e51.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274988132336113_7685690556adb313bbf4c9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261023100146166-1023_00862_001_06p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274988132336113_7685690556adb313bbf4c9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927498866481616_14715401676adb314018cd0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"minchen333_1792653950_4013378076225675549_202698442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927498866481616_14715401676adb314018cd0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274989594414594_3216914866adb3149dc4ba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"minchen333_1792653950_4013378074203982748_202698442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274989594414594_3216914866adb3149dc4ba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274990266374582_3609170016adb3150245bc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"minchen333_1792653950_4013378074120219732_202698442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274990266374582_3609170016adb3150245bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274990858380464_8416344826adb31566d40c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"minchen333_1792653950_4013378074388671402_202698442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274990858380464_8416344826adb31566d40c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:24:03.700419+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1162,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:05:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:17.885867+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:26.994107+00:00","content_hash":"bf3358f9bd6b516b7fbd40a2e7eea2d1dd12181bc35c2a694abc148f8dccbc82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}